# Dependencies and build outputs should be produced inside the image,
# not copied from the host (host artifacts may target a different OS/ABI —
# Prisma engines in particular must be generated on the target platform).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Test artifacts
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Local environment — never ship dev secrets into an image
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Editor and VCS metadata
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/*.log

# Docs are not needed at build time
**/*.md
